import LOEIS.A000.A000035.Defs

set_option linter.unusedVariables false

/-!
# A000035

Period 2: repeat [0, 1]; a(n) = n mod 2; parity of n.

The 105 terms known to OEIS, indexed from `0`.

Skeleton generated by `lake exe oeis-gen`; every declaration is a `sorry` placeholder.
-/

namespace A000035

